rplab/chiaki-probe.patch - experiment hooks for libchiaki (chiaki-ng/lib), used by the Remote Play lab only.

rplab/build.sh applies it to a throwaway copy of chiaki-ng in out/rplab/chiaki-ng and builds that into its own
staging (out/rplab/chiaki-lib): the submodule, out/chiaki-lib-macos and the app's builds never see it. The hooks
(lib/include/chiaki/probe.h) do nothing unless rpd calls them: extra controller states per feedback packet,
ControllerConnection messages, raw feedback history events, session setup headers and the launch spec, and
readable logs of the console's session and ctrl responses. Edit the copy, then rplab/build.sh --save-patch.

